          "en": "the Mongo module here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 185,
          "start": 536.9,
          "end": 540.76,
          "en": "that it's not doing anything fishy with those permissions.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 186,
          "start": 540.76,
          "end": 544.27,
          "en": "So we're almost back in the Node world here.",
